<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Macrovision initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Macrovision initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said on Thursday it initiated coverage of Macrovision Corp with a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Montgomery was the lead underwriting of the company's March initial public offering at $9 a share.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/2 at 9 late Thursday afternoon.</p>
</text>
